    "id": "op.lcd.r5.d",
    "text": "10 seconds after lighting up with no operation, or 2 hours after entering always-on mode.",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "id": "chg.h",
    "text": "CHARGING",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "id": "chg.first",
    "text": "Fully charge the product before its first use.",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "id": "chg.caution.l",
    "text": "CAUTION",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "id": "chg.caution.i1",
    "text": "The recommended charging temperature for the product ranges from 32°F to 113°F (0°C to 45°C) and the discharging temperature ranges from -4°F to 113°F ( -20°C to 45°C). Operating the product beyond this temperature range may restrict its charging and discharging capabilities, or even prevent it from charging or discharging.",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "id": "chg.caution.i2",
    "text": "The charging power and battery capacity of the product may vary due to temperature fluctuations.",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "id": "chg.usbc.h",
    "text": "CHARGING VIA A USB-C CHARGER",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "id": "chg.usbc.sold",
    "text": "USB-C charger sold separately.",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "id": "chg.solar.h",
    "text": "CHARGING VIA SOLAR PANELS (SOLD SEPARATELY)",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "id": "chg.solar.p",
    "text": "This product supports a maximum solar charging power of 100W and can be used with the Jackery SolarSaga series solar panels.",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "id": "chg.solar.by",
    "text": "Charged by 40W or 100W solar panel:",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "id": "fig.solar.panel",
    "text": "SolarSaga 40 Air x1",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 10,
    "id": "chg.solar.sold",
    "text": "The DC8020 to USB-C cable is sold separately.",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "id": "chg.solar.rec",
    "text": "It is recommended to use the Jackery solar panel to charge the product. Ensure that the open-circuit voltage (Voc) of the solar panel is within the DC input range (10V-30V) of the 100D. Jackery is not responsible for any damage or loss resulting from the use of third-party solar panels.",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "id": "chg.car.h",
    "text": "CHARGING VIA A CAR CHARGER (SOLD SEPARATELY)",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "id": "chg.car.p",
    "text": "This product can be charged using 12V and 24V car chargers. Ensure that the car charger and the car power outlet (car cigarette lighter) provide a good connection.",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "id": "fig.car.vehicle",
    "text": "Vehicle",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "id": "chg.car.sold",
    "text": "The car charging cable and DC8020 to USB-C cable are sold separately.",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "id": "chg.car.caution.l",
    "text": "CAUTION",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "id": "chg.car.caution.i1",
    "text": "Please start the vehicle before charging your power bank.",
    "source_ocr_char_coverage": 1.0
  },
  {
    "page": 11,
    "id": "chg.car.caution.i2",
    "text": "If the vehicle is running on bumpy roads, it is forbidden to use the car charger, to avoid burning caused by poor contact. The Company will not be responsible for any loss caused by improper use.",
